===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=6|fährt ab|fuhr ab|abgefahren|past subjunctive=führe ab|auxiliary=both}}

# to [[depart]], to [[leave]]
#* ''[[Ihr|Ihr]] [[Zug]] '''fährt''' [[um]] [[fünf]] [[Uhr]] '''ab.'''''
#*: Her train departs at 5 o'clock.
#* ''[[wir|Wir]] [[werden]] [[morgen]] '''abfahren.'''
#*: We will leave tomorrow
# {{lb|de|colloquial}} to be crazy about something.
#* ''[[sie|Sie]] '''fährt''' [[voll]] [[auf]] [[Kultfilm]]e '''ab.'''''
#*: She's really crazy about cult movies.

